key from the environment (`CODEX_API_KEY`), so it\nneeds nothing from the home folder.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":17,"oldLines":6,"newStart":17,"newLines":10,"lines":[" Lanes:"," "," - `codex`: Codex CLI (`codex exec --json`), unsandboxed.","+- `codex-sandboxed`: the same Codex run, with its shell under `sandbox/agent.sb`","+  and a scratch `CODEX_HOME` (seeded with `auth.json` and `config.toml` from","+  `~/.codex`). Codex writes its last message to a scratch folder in `/tmp`, which","+  the lane copies to `final.txt` after the run."," - `kimi`: Kimi Code. Its output goes to Moonshot, so its shell runs under the","   macOS sandbox profile `sandbox/agent.sb` (no reading or writing the real","   home), with an empty scratch HOME. Kimi's own install and sessions live in"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01M8VbF1z1LG9t3Jjf6d4WSJ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
